<title>USA: Rock-Tenn sets stock and cash divs.</title>
<headline>Rock-Tenn sets stock and cash divs.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rock-Tenn Co said Thursday it has set a 10 percent stock dividend on its Class A and Class B common stock payable to stockholders of record as of November 4.</p>
<p>It is be paid out on November 15.</p>
<p>The company also set a cash dividend of $0.075 per share payable November 15 to shareholders of record on November 4. The newly-issued shares will also receive this cash dividend.</p>
<p>Rock-Tenn manufactures clay coated and uncoated recycled paperboard.</p>
</text>
